### 상점 조회 API
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/pages/recommend
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
X-Shop-Layout-Variant: {{shopLayoutVariant}}

### 상품 목록 조회 API (인테리어, 인기순)
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/products?tab=INTERIOR&sort=POPULAR&size=3
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 목록 조회 API (인테리어, 기간 한정 칩)
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/products?tab=INTERIOR&category=LIMITED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 목록 조회 API (방 배경, 가격 높은 순)
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/products?tab=BACKGROUND&sort=PRICE_DESC
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 프로모션 상품 목록 조회 API (배너 링크 /shop/promotions/{promotionId})
@promotionId = 3
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/promotions/{{promotionId}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상단 바 조회 API
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 장바구니 조회 API
GET {{url}}/api/v1/shop/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 장바구니 담기 API
POST {{url}}/api/v1/shop/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 115,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 장바구니 수량 변경 API
@productId = 117
PUT {{url}}/api/v1/shop/cart/items/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### 장바구니 선택 변경 API
PUT {{url}}/api/v1/shop/cart/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productIds": [117, 121]
}

### 장바구니 빼기 API
DELETE {{url}}/api/v1/shop/cart/items?productIds=117,121
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
